From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Electron Customizations <customizations@example.invalid>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0800
Subject: feat: inset desktop viewport scrollbars around host corners

Host-owned renderer preferences default off. Preserve upstream Fluent
appearance; adjust native main-frame scrollbar geometry and relayout
when the host radius changes. This is a desktop-edition enhancement.

